msgid "these GGUF files are not one split model: they disagree about '%(key)s', declaring %(values)s"
msgstr "de här GGUF-filerna är inte en enda uppdelad modell: de är oense om '%(key)s' och anger %(values)s"

# "Shard" is the word Swedish developers use for a piece of a split model; the literal
# "skärva" would read as a piece of broken glass.
msgid "Pass the shards of one model, not of several."
msgstr "Ange shards från en enda modell, inte från flera."

msgid "no GGUF header to read facts from"
msgstr "ingen GGUF-header att läsa fakta ur"

msgid "Pass the model's file, or every shard of a split model."
msgstr "Ange modellens fil, eller varje shard i en uppdelad modell."

msgid "%(count)d GGUF file of the %(total)d given carries no '%(key)s' key, so its place in a split model cannot be established"
